      "text": "第3题"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "已知:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "H<sub>2</sub>S水溶液的酸式解离常数: = 1.1×10−7 = 1.3×10−13"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "ZnS的溶度积常数: <sub>\\$%</sub> = 2.5×10−22"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CuS的溶度积常数: <sub>\\$%</sub> = 6.3×10−36"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<table><tr><td> $NO_{3}^{-} + 4H^{+} + 3e^{-} \\rightleftharpoons NO + 2H_{2}O$ </td><td> $E_{1}^{\\ominus} = 0.957V$ </td></tr><tr><td> $S + 2H^{+} + 2e^{-} \\rightleftharpoons H_{2}S$ </td><td> $E_{2}^{\\ominus} = 0.142V$ </td></tr><tr><td> $S + 2e^{-} \\rightleftharpoons S^{2-}$ </td><td> $E_{3}^{\\ominus} = -0.476V$ </td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "3-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "ZnS可以溶于稀盐酸,反应式为:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "\\mathrm{ZnS} + 2 \\mathrm{H} ^ {+} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{Zn} ^ {2 +} + \\mathrm{H} _ {2} \\mathrm{S}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "拟将0.010molZnS溶于1升盐酸中,求所需盐酸的最低浓度."
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-002539"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "3-2",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "CuS 可以溶于 $\\mathrm { HNO _ { 3 } } ,$ ,反应式为:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "3 \\mathrm{CuS} + 2 \\mathrm{NO} ^ {-} + 8 \\mathrm{H} ^ {+} \\rightleftharpoons3 \\mathrm{Cu} ^ {2 +} + 2 \\mathrm{NO} + 3 \\mathrm{S} + 4 \\mathrm{H} _ {2} \\mathrm{O}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "求该反应的平衡常数 $K ^ { \\ominus } { } _ { \\mathfrak { c } }$"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-002540"
    }
